The TLV8 codec and the uncompressed ALAC frame layout are ported from
airplay2-sender-cpp. See docs/architecture.md for the reference split.

The WASAPI shared-mode loopback capture approach in internal/capture is
ported from AirFlash (native/airflash-engine/src/live.rs). The AirPlay PTP
wire profile, PTP follower state machine, and sender-side PTP master in
internal/airplay/ptp are ported from AirFlash
(native/airflash-engine/src/clock.rs).

Runtime dependencies and their licenses are listed in docs/architecture.md.
